@startuml
title SA-ROLE01 · 账号与配置角色
caption UC-01～03 / BR-12、17～26、33、50 / To-Be Proposed
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang SC
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction
actor "访客" as A
actor "配置主负责人" as O
actor "已分配副负责人" as D
rectangle "平台配置责任" {
 usecase "注册与登录" as Log
 usecase "创建、编辑和查找配置" as Edit
 usecase "增减负责人或转交" as Transfer
 usecase "编辑获分配配置" as Limited
}
A --> Log
O --> Edit
O --> Transfer
D --> Limited
note bottom of Limited : 编辑按当前角色。\n需求副负责人不能启动或进入运行聊天。
@enduml
